To estimate the interventional (in)direct effects, two sets of linear regression models were used. The first model (Eq. 2) was estimated by regressing COVID-19 hospitalization (Y) on education (A) and mediators (Ms) conditional on covariates (C).2\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
