To account for these potential interactions, sensitivity analyses were performed by including three types of interactions in the outcome model: exposure-mediator, mediator-mediator, and exposure-mediator-mediator interactions. The outcome model was therefore specified as shown in Eq. 4, where \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
